{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jon-2-1","title":"Jonah 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prayer of Jonah. 10 He is delivered out of the belly of the fish.</p>\n<p>prayed. 2Ch 33:11-13; Ps 50:15; 91:15; Isa 26:16; Ho 5:15; 6:1-3; Jas 5:13 out. Job 13:15; Ps 130:1,2; La 3:53-56; Ac 16:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jon-2-2","title":"Jonah 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>I cried. Ge 32:7-12,24-28; 1Sa 30:6; Ps 4:1; 18:4-6; 22:24; 34:6; 65:2 Ps 120:1; 142:1-3; Lu 22:44; Heb 5:7 by reason of mine. or, out of mine. 1Sa 1:16 out. Ps 18:5,6; 61:2; 86:13; 88:1-7; 116:3 hell. or, the grave. Ps 16:10; Isa 14:9; Mt 12:40; Ac 2:27 and thou. Ps 34:6; 65:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jon-2-3","title":"Jonah 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>thou. 1:12-16; Ps 69:1,2,14,15; 88:5-8; La 3:54 midst. Heb. heart. all. Ps 42:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jon-2-4","title":"Jonah 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>I said. Ps 31:22; 77:1-7; Isa 38:10-14,17; 49:14; Eze 37:11 out. 1Ki 9:7; Jer 7:15; 15:1 toward. 1Ki 8:38,39,42,48; 2Ch 6:38; Ps 5:7; Da 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jon-2-5","title":"Jonah 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Ps 40:2; 69:1,2; La 3:54</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jon-2-6","title":"Jonah 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>bottoms. Heb. cuttings off. mountains. De 32:22; Ps 65:6; 104:6,8; Isa 40:12; Hab 3:6,10 the earth. Job 38:4-11; Pr 8:25-29 yet. Ps 16:10; Isa 38:17; Ac 13:33-37 corruption. or, the pit. Job 33:24,28; Ps 30:3,9; 55:23; 143:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jon-2-7","title":"Jonah 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>my soul. Ps 22:14; 27:13; 119:81-83; Heb 12:3 I remembered. 1Sa 30:6; Ps 20:7; 42:5,11; 43:5; 77:10,11; 143:5; Isa 50:10 La 3:21-26; 2Co 1:9,10 my prayer. 2Ch 30:27; Ps 18:6 holy. 4; Ps 11:4; 65:4; Mic 1:2; Hab 2:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jon-2-8","title":"Jonah 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>1Sa 12:21; 2Ki 17:15; Ps 31:6; Jer 2:13; 10:8,14,15; 16:19 Hab 2:18-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jon-2-9","title":"Jonah 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I will sacrifice. Ge 35:3; Ps 50:14,23; 66:13-15; 107:22; 116:17,18; Jer 33:11 Ho 14:2; Ro 12:1; Heb 13:15 I will pay. De 23:18; 2Sa 15:7; Job 22:27; Ec 5:4,5 Salvation. Ps 3:8; 37:39,40; 68:20; Isa 45:17; Joh 4:22; Ac 4:12; Re 7:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jon-2-10","title":"Jonah 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JON","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>1:17; Ge 1:3,7,9,11,14; Ps 33:9; 105:31,34; Isa 50:2 Mt 8:8,9,26,27</p>"}]}